review:
+In theory the game is fun.
-Menus look bad; 
-Characters take long to grind and kinda feel the same;
-Can't ignore/avoid players that play out of role or just don't play.
-No chat so you comunicate with players in emotes, they are just NPCs there's no human interaction.
+Dubu.

1) Most skills feel disconnected and out of place;
2) playing with phone players in a game is the worst thing to have in this type of game and is loss 100% of the time;
3) no practice zone when you take new hero;
4) art of the heroes appeals only to Japan market i guess
5) most champ dashes are a joke
6) overall not sure who tested the game for 1 year and what feedback they gave but it looks they were all under 10 years old and hit by a truck
